<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak Jan-Sept budget deficit SKK 13.4 bln.</title>
<headline>Slovak Jan-Sept budget deficit SKK 13.4 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovakia's state budget deficit widened to 13.4 billion crowns for the January- September period from a 7.9 billion crown shortfall for the first eight months of 1996, a central bank statement said.  </p>
<p> SLOVAK STATE BUDGET    Jan-Sept    Jan-Aug   1996 (estimate)</p>
<p>  Expenditure (SKK bln)  133.0	 114.4	 189.425</p>
<p>  Revenues		   119.6	 106.5	 162.425</p>
<p>  Balance		    -13.4	  -7.9	 -27.000</p>
<p>Note: 1996 estimate based on the government's budget plan which was approved by parliament.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
